{"id": "85810", "name": "נגזרת – לינאריות, tan ועוד cos עם מקדמים שבריים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find the following derivative:</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}\\left( {{CT:1}}\\right) = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Linearity of the derivative</b><br><p>In order to solve this problem we will have to use the linearity rules for differentiation.</p><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">Linearity: \\( \\frac{d}{dx}\\left(af(x)+bg(x)\\right)=af'(x)+bg'(x) \\)</div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}\\left( {{CT:1}}\\right) &= \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}\\left( {{CT:2}}\\right) +\\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}\\left[ {{CT:3}}\\right] \\\\ &= {{CT:4}}\\cdot \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}({{CT:5}})+\\left({{CT:6}}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}[{{CT:7}}] \\\\ &= {{CT:4}}\\cdot \\left( {{CT:8}}\\right) +\\left({{CT:6}}\\right)\\cdot \\left({{CT:9}}\\right) \\\\ &= {{CT:10}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "q2:ppp1+ppp2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(p,v)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(q2,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You appear to have forgotten the coefficients {{CT:11}} and {{CT:12}}.   Remember: \\[\\frac{d}{dx}(k\\cdot f)=k\\cdot \\frac{df}{dx}.\\]</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp1", "pp2", "ppp1", "ppp2", "rdm1", "rdm2", "v"], "nvariants": 9}